16:09:10 INFO RULE: interpretation rule (fixed 2026-11-19 before the results): per PLURAL version P (pq5, plc) and its county-mean version Pcm, tract MdAPE of all tracts per year, judged where |P - v5.7| > 1.0 pp: cell_level = |Pcm - v5.7| <= 0.5 pp (the cell values of plural cause the tract loss); county_level = |Pcm - P| <= 0.5 pp (the changed county prediction itself causes it); beyond_v57 = Pcm past v5.7 by more than 0.5 pp; further = Pcm further from v5.7 than P by more than 0.5 pp; partial = in between (recovered = (P - Pcm) / (P - v5.7)); not_judged where |P - v5.7| <= 1.0 pp. Other tract sets: same numbers, not judged. A cause check, not a selection; the user decides
